+$foo-color: #FFF;
+
+.bar {
+  background: linear-gradient(top, #CC2, #44D);
+}
+
+.baz {
+  color: #12A;
+}
+```
+
+In both cases the following will be allowed as the values contain only numbers:
+
+```scss
+.qux {
+  color: #123;
+}
