Paths bug
### Describe the bug

Error compiling path aliases. The paths must either remain unchanged or point to the file.

### Input code

```typescript
// src/utils.ts
export const str = "";

// src/app/src/index.ts
import { str } from "$utils";
console.log(str);
```


### Config

```json
{
    "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/swcrc",
    "jsc": {
        "baseUrl": "./",
        "paths": {
            "$utils": [
                "./src/utils.ts"
            ]
        }
    }
}
```


### Playground link (or link to the minimal reproduction)

https://github.com/AlexRMU/

